// "Braces against an incoming surge, blunting the blow" -- a self
// damage-reduction ward, same `SelfBuff`+`ProtectingWard` primitive as
// blade_ward.ron/resistance.ron (Wave-1 Abjuration). Sheet's `cast_time:
// Reaction` is compendium-only presentational metadata (no real trigger-
// on-being-hit mechanic exists to gate an ability on); kept in the
// compendium entry as flavor, same as every other Reaction-tagged spell
// in this pass. "Turning part of its force back on its source" reflect
// rider dropped -- no reflect/thorns `BuffEffect` exists.
//
// Reviewer correction: original strength 0.3 for 60 energy at a level-24
// gate was strictly dominated by the unleveled shield.ron (strength 0.35
// for 15 energy). Re-costed above shield.ron's baseline to actually
// justify the level gate: higher strength, modest energy.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    cast_duration: 0.15,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.45, duration: Some(6.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 30.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Abjuration),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 4 spell -> min_level 24, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(24)),
    ),
)
